    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/c8b7349b1d5fea8550d9cea003d34913.webp?t=1750753253\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/616bb6514c8be920294914a636b7e952.poster.avif?t=1750753253\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/616bb6514c8be920294914a636b7e952.webm?t=1750753253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/616bb6514c8be920294914a636b7e952.mp4?t=1750753253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;A good soldier always follows orders...&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrust into the macabre depths of Site 41, you play as a disoriented soldier caught in an emergency of seismic proportions. Navigate disturbing environments, unravel cryptic puzzles and uncover grotesque truths in this chilling, thrilling reinvention of the point-and-click horror genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/7364db8cb28f45ecdd0b02ea59381d60.avif?t=1750753253\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/a10cbfa68a9939b608ae08fd5a4ef1f0.poster.avif?t=1750753253\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/a10cbfa68a9939b608ae08fd5a4ef1f0.webm?t=1750753253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/a10cbfa68a9939b608ae08fd5a4ef1f0.mp4?t=1750753253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TERMINAL ERROR </strong>unfolds within the bleak and oppressive tunnels of Site 41, a secretive underground facility harbouring classified, experimental technologies. Constructed by the Island Armed Forces (IAF), a paranoid military obsessed with maintaining their iron grip on military supremacy, the compound was meant to be a fortress of cutting edge power. But this perfect machine conceals some dark secrets\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/3b3307c42c28efebf9acdb9133bf8758.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/3b3307c42c28efebf9acdb9133bf8758.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins when a disoriented soldier awakens alone in a suspiciously desolate guardhouse. Contacting a mysterious ally through the crackling radio, the newfound allies investigate the cause of the facility-wide shutdown in hopes of containing the source of the disaster. Yet, what they uncover is far more horrifying and deadly. Descend into a nightmarish rabbit hole of hidden horrors and dangerous secrets lurking beneath the surface...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/c6b2b9837636ac740a64763f32e120b9.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/c6b2b9837636ac740a64763f32e120b9.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/261abd39354466e7bf83f7eee126e98d.poster.avif?t=1750753253\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/261abd39354466e7bf83f7eee126e98d.webm?t=1750753253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/261abd39354466e7bf83f7eee126e98d.mp4?t=1750753253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact and Experience:</strong> Unravel unsettling mysterious through our revamped point-and-click mechanics, now with a heightened sense of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mess around with strange devices...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/4fe7fbbde8dcca55450682e0241598a9.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/4fe7fbbde8dcca55450682e0241598a9.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up items...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/4ef0d7201bd51d2ce494f2c0dc02b5e1.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/4ef0d7201bd51d2ce494f2c0dc02b5e1.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix up broken parts...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/29f49ed09ebab065d953dce0db78e01e.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/29f49ed09ebab065d953dce0db78e01e.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve challenging puzzles...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/5c7aa2b3691c4dca14f8384a9b137f3f.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/5c7aa2b3691c4dca14f8384a9b137f3f.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And maybe make a friend along the way...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/105d5c6bd03eb8bd8a5c824a73388299.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/105d5c6bd03eb8bd8a5c824a73388299.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and Discover:</strong>\u00a0Suspiciously abandoned and packed with secrets, learn about the lore of this strange world as you roam the eerie corridors of Site 41.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through oppressively imposing tunnels...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/8f9f5646ae3ea7fb660716b9af9c187d.avif?t=1750753253\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creep past bleak offices...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/31378f188f1a6355c5379a4af0c4e4d8.avif?t=1750753253\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And encounter the infection...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/9c5abaf29b65f1b1cfda7063d94b0750.avif?t=1750753253\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with Tools:</strong> Armed with your <i><strong>Cybernetic Compatibility System (CCS)</strong></i>, access a variety of tools to aid you in your journey. Use your trusty torchlight to reveal what's hidden in the dark</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/14b1a24341ea72da6e1018e9a51c5cd5.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/14b1a24341ea72da6e1018e9a51c5cd5.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/34db1e5441ac296ce69decee546222f6.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/34db1e5441ac296ce69decee546222f6.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dangers around every corner, heal up with our fresh take on the traditional healing experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/34b564ec2f54dbe792f4623216de5acd.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/34b564ec2f54dbe792f4623216de5acd.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stun and run from enemies as you explore... The bullets might not kill monsters, but at least it slow them down. If you're lucky, maybe you could slip away in time...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/ca2a2dc97e2eabf0d95415dae27153eb.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/ca2a2dc97e2eabf0d95415dae27153eb.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/3833ca361079c915b4ea2631934e6ed6.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/3833ca361079c915b4ea2631934e6ed6.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape Monsters:</strong> Encounter grotesque monsters and explore haunting spaces plastered with flesh, blood and all forms of warped monstrosities as you learn more about the cryptic truth of the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/fb9c121cf9b947fb01dbfabc5b3ee06e.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/fb9c121cf9b947fb01dbfabc5b3ee06e.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get too close to the monsters though... They can easily grab you, entering into an interesting 'Struggling Minigame' sequence to escape the grasps of these creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/21937471894b6a3df701c27ce67eabd1.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/21937471894b6a3df701c27ce67eabd1.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stop the Infection:</strong> Uncover a story of obedience, control and the price of breaking free</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/8ecdd137b96312379683b477bbb3d7be.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/8ecdd137b96312379683b477bbb3d7be.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/c8b7349b1d5fea8550d9cea003d34913.webp?t=1750753253\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/c8b7349b1d5fea8550d9cea003d34913.webp?t=1750753253\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/616bb6514c8be920294914a636b7e952.poster.avif?t=1750753253\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/616bb6514c8be920294914a636b7e952.webm?t=1750753253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/616bb6514c8be920294914a636b7e952.mp4?t=1750753253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;A good soldier always follows orders...&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrust into the macabre depths of Site 41, you play as a disoriented soldier caught in an emergency of seismic proportions. Navigate disturbing environments, unravel cryptic puzzles and uncover grotesque truths in this chilling, thrilling reinvention of the point-and-click horror genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/7364db8cb28f45ecdd0b02ea59381d60.avif?t=1750753253\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/a10cbfa68a9939b608ae08fd5a4ef1f0.poster.avif?t=1750753253\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/a10cbfa68a9939b608ae08fd5a4ef1f0.webm?t=1750753253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/a10cbfa68a9939b608ae08fd5a4ef1f0.mp4?t=1750753253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TERMINAL ERROR </strong>unfolds within the bleak and oppressive tunnels of Site 41, a secretive underground facility harbouring classified, experimental technologies. Constructed by the Island Armed Forces (IAF), a paranoid military obsessed with maintaining their iron grip on military supremacy, the compound was meant to be a fortress of cutting edge power. But this perfect machine conceals some dark secrets\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/3b3307c42c28efebf9acdb9133bf8758.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/3b3307c42c28efebf9acdb9133bf8758.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins when a disoriented soldier awakens alone in a suspiciously desolate guardhouse. Contacting a mysterious ally through the crackling radio, the newfound allies investigate the cause of the facility-wide shutdown in hopes of containing the source of the disaster. Yet, what they uncover is far more horrifying and deadly. Descend into a nightmarish rabbit hole of hidden horrors and dangerous secrets lurking beneath the surface...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/c6b2b9837636ac740a64763f32e120b9.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/c6b2b9837636ac740a64763f32e120b9.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/261abd39354466e7bf83f7eee126e98d.poster.avif?t=1750753253\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/261abd39354466e7bf83f7eee126e98d.webm?t=1750753253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/261abd39354466e7bf83f7eee126e98d.mp4?t=1750753253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact and Experience:</strong> Unravel unsettling mysterious through our revamped point-and-click mechanics, now with a heightened sense of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mess around with strange devices...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/4fe7fbbde8dcca55450682e0241598a9.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/4fe7fbbde8dcca55450682e0241598a9.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up items...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/4ef0d7201bd51d2ce494f2c0dc02b5e1.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/4ef0d7201bd51d2ce494f2c0dc02b5e1.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix up broken parts...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/29f49ed09ebab065d953dce0db78e01e.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/29f49ed09ebab065d953dce0db78e01e.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve challenging puzzles...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/5c7aa2b3691c4dca14f8384a9b137f3f.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/5c7aa2b3691c4dca14f8384a9b137f3f.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And maybe make a friend along the way...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/105d5c6bd03eb8bd8a5c824a73388299.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/105d5c6bd03eb8bd8a5c824a73388299.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and Discover:</strong>\u00a0Suspiciously abandoned and packed with secrets, learn about the lore of this strange world as you roam the eerie corridors of Site 41.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through oppressively imposing tunnels...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/8f9f5646ae3ea7fb660716b9af9c187d.avif?t=1750753253\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creep past bleak offices...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/31378f188f1a6355c5379a4af0c4e4d8.avif?t=1750753253\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And encounter the infection...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/9c5abaf29b65f1b1cfda7063d94b0750.avif?t=1750753253\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with Tools:</strong> Armed with your <i><strong>Cybernetic Compatibility System (CCS)</strong></i>, access a variety of tools to aid you in your journey. Use your trusty torchlight to reveal what's hidden in the dark</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/14b1a24341ea72da6e1018e9a51c5cd5.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/14b1a24341ea72da6e1018e9a51c5cd5.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/34db1e5441ac296ce69decee546222f6.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/34db1e5441ac296ce69decee546222f6.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dangers around every corner, heal up with our fresh take on the traditional healing experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/34b564ec2f54dbe792f4623216de5acd.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/34b564ec2f54dbe792f4623216de5acd.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stun and run from enemies as you explore... The bullets might not kill monsters, but at least it slow them down. If you're lucky, maybe you could slip away in time...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/ca2a2dc97e2eabf0d95415dae27153eb.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/ca2a2dc97e2eabf0d95415dae27153eb.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/3833ca361079c915b4ea2631934e6ed6.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/3833ca361079c915b4ea2631934e6ed6.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape Monsters:</strong> Encounter grotesque monsters and explore haunting spaces plastered with flesh, blood and all forms of warped monstrosities as you learn more about the cryptic truth of the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/fb9c121cf9b947fb01dbfabc5b3ee06e.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/fb9c121cf9b947fb01dbfabc5b3ee06e.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get too close to the monsters though... They can easily grab you, entering into an interesting 'Struggling Minigame' sequence to escape the grasps of these creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/21937471894b6a3df701c27ce67eabd1.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/21937471894b6a3df701c27ce67eabd1.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stop the Infection:</strong> Uncover a story of obedience, control and the price of breaking free</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/8ecdd137b96312379683b477bbb3d7be.poster.webp?t=1750753253\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/8ecdd137b96312379683b477bbb3d7be.webp?t=1750753253\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502430/extras/c8b7349b1d5fea8550d9cea003d34913.webp?t=1750753253\" /></span></p>",
